  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 758881,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1 Year Triangle: A Commodore 64 Classic\n\nPlunge into the heart of the Pacific Theater in *1 Year Triangle*, a thrilling vertical-scrolling shooter for the Commodore 64! Inspired by the iconic *1942*, this game throws you into the cockpit of a Lockheed P-38 Lightning, battling relentless waves of Japanese aircraft across a beautifully rendered island chain. \n\nExperience the intensity of World War II as you navigate treacherous waters and engage in frantic dogfights. Collect powerful upgrades to enhance your firepower and utilize a daring defensive loop maneuver to evade enemy attacks – but be warned, you only have three lives! A dynamic map displays your progress, adding a strategic layer to the fast-paced action. \n\n*1 Year Triangle* delivers classic arcade thrills with stunning Commodore 64 graphics and a pulse-pounding soundtrack. Prepare for a challenging and rewarding experience as you strive to conquer the skies and defend freedom in this unforgettable retro adventure."
    },
